    dcterms:identifier "P160010" ;
    rdfs:comment "SPARQL compatibility refers to the extent to which a software tool or system is able to work effectively with SPARQL, a query language for querying RDF data. In the context of research contributions, claiming SPARQL compatibility indicates support for querying RDF data and interoperability with other Semantic Web tools and datasets."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/orkg-properties-ontology-consolidated> ;
    skos:prefLabel "SPARQL compatibility"@en .

