orkg:P184216 a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "hydropower scheme type"@en ;
    dcterms:created "2025-12-18T20:25:35.443982+01:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:identifier "P184216" ;
    rdfs:comment "Hydropower scheme type refers to the classification or category of a hydropower project based on its design, operation, and technology used. This property helps to specify the nature of the hydropower system studied or proposed in the research, such as run-of-river, reservoir-based, pumped storage, or tidal power schemes. Identifying the hydropower scheme type is crucial for understanding the research contribution related to energy generation methods, environmental impact, efficiency, and technological innovation in hydropower development."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/orkg-properties-ontology-consolidated> ;
    skos:prefLabel "hydropower scheme type"@en .

orkg:P184217 a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "power plant scale"@en ;
    dcterms:created "2025-12-18T20:28:59.886245+01:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:identifier "P184217" ;
    rdfs:comment "Power plant scale refers to the size or capacity of a power generation facility, typically measured in terms of its output capacity (e.g., megawatts). This property is important for characterizing the scope and impact of research related to power plants, including their design, efficiency, environmental impact, and economic feasibility."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/orkg-properties-ontology-consolidated> ;
    skos:prefLabel "power plant scale"@en .

orkg:P184218 a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "power plant type"@en ;
    dcterms:created "2025-12-18T20:30:04.101470+01:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:identifier "P184218" ;
    rdfs:comment "The 'power plant type' predicate specifies the category or classification of a power generation facility discussed or analyzed in the research. This property helps to identify the specific kind of power plant (e.g., coal-fired, nuclear, hydroelectric, solar, wind) that is the focus of the study, enabling a clear understanding of the technological or methodological contributions related to that type of power generation."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/orkg-properties-ontology-consolidated> ;
    skos:prefLabel "power plant type"@en .

