    dcterms:identifier "P184310" ;
    rdfs:comment "Type of Inquiry refers to the classification of the research based on the nature and approach of the investigation conducted in the paper. It indicates whether the study is exploratory, descriptive, explanatory, evaluative, or a combination thereof, helping to understand the methodological framework and the kind of knowledge the research aims to generate."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/orkg-properties-ontology-consolidated> ;
